{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1501959-the-walkers-of-l-a-lesser-template","id":1501959,"title":"The Walkers Of L.A [Lesser Template]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-02T10:08:41-08:00","id":1501959,"title":"The Walkers Of L.A [Lesser Template]","content":"So in it's 2e, corenook,mage presents Los Angeles as a city of dreams, quite literally.<br /> and that is due to the phenomenon of Walkers who people being Claimed by Astral Goetia without the interference of the Mind and Spirit Arcanum.<br /> Skme celebrities were being claimed by Goetia of themselves which forced them to act in stereotypical way the public think celebrities act... That made me wonder, what if we draw a parallel with Beast? A Beast would happily tell you they're not mere goetia- claimed,<br /> They'd tell you that their Horrors are not only Goetia but something far more terrifying and older. The question is:<br /> <br /> What if that applies to the celebrity goetia as well? And the Walkers of L.A are a Beast-equivalent where their Horror equivalent is a evolved goetia of everyone's thoughts about them? Without further ado here's The Walker Template:<br /> <br /> <br /> Walker<ul><li>The Walkers of L.A have no Family or Hunger as such, but each type of celebrity they represent is their Family and while they don't have Hungers, they have Wants that define them. Instead of Satiety, they have Realization. Feeding their Want gives Realization the same way a beat gains Satiety</li> <li>Walkers have Legend and Life as Beasts, but as appropriated for celebrities instead of mythical monsters.</li> <li>Walkers have no Atavism but their Nightmare equivalent are stronger, their Nightmares are called Impressions and always benefit from a Satiety expenditure equivalent. Impressions also get stronger from high Realization</li> <li>They have no Lair but can open portals to the Astral and can gain Influences based on the Geotic Resonance of Celebrity</li> <li>Walkers get a Perfect Social Impression with fans of the Celebrity they represent</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Example:<br /> <br /> <br /> The Sports Star has the &quot;Win Competitions of Athletic Skill&quot; Want. The Star Legend is Champion and their life is Lover. They access to the following Impression and has Influence Fervor 5<br /> <br /> Sample Nightmare <br /> And the Crowd Goes Wild<br /> <br /> You can't help but love the Sports Star when he does something impressive<br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Dexterity + Athletics vs Resolve + Supernatural Tolerance<br /> <br /> <br /> Effect: the subject gains the charmed condition<br /> <br /> <br /> High Realization: the Subject gets the Swooned condition<br /> <br /> <br /> Realization Expenditure (always on unless turned off): The Athlete will have Perfect Social Impression with all subjects of this Impression for the remainder of the Chapter<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 09-30-2023, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}